self=21 recv=1 free=2 rows=22 blind_names=1 blind_calls=45
== SURF_CARD
# CARD (DELTA11 R2): an OUT position holding Option / Vec / a slice / an array / two or more
# `bool`, with MEANS (hand): caller | hit:<question> | list:<what> ; a missing row FAILS CARD,
# a row matching no position is STALE. First rows at LS2a.
# §5.2 Q-DECLKEY DK1-4b-2 (2026-11-24): the four walk entries' RET `Option<DeclKey>` (the key found, or none) ; Keyed::get_found (as get_at)
# §5.2 Q-DECLKEY DK1-5a (2026-11-25): hier_resolve RET Option<V> (the leaf table's value under the resolved key, or none)
# §5.2 Q-DECLKEY DK1-5b (2026-11-25): keys_under_cur RET Vec<&NewKey> (the package fold's saved keys under the current scope, each once, in key-text order: the order decl_keep_snapshot records and decl_keep_restore replays)
# §5.2 Q-DECLKEY DK2 (2026-11-26, form (c)): the four walks are private: their RET rows gone ; the 23 named entries' RET Option<DeclKey> rows added by the pass, means as the walks'
# §5.2 Q-DECLKEY DK3-a (2026-11-26): + net_key_shown (hit) and net_name_table (list) ; bare_name_of_net's Option is LEAVE L13's row
